@startuml
' Low-code skeleton generation & palette refresh (Section 4.6)
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title Low-code editor — from template to palette

start
:Open Low-code Editor;
:Choose template (Python | External);
if (Language == Python?) then (yes)
  :Generate subclass skeleton\nsetup()/execute(), I/O pins;
else (no)
  :Generate wrapper + script boilerplate\nread input.json, write output.json;
endif
:Write files to custom_plugins/;
:Mark metadata (category="Custom");
:Trigger discovery;
:Scan plugins/ and custom_plugins/;
:Update palette (add node);
stop
@enduml
